 lượng in thêu.</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase text-xs\">2. Dung sai kích thước &amp; màu sắc cho phép:</h4><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-600\"><li>Dung sai thông số may: ±1.0 cm đến ±1.5 cm tùy vị trí theo quy chuẩn dệt may công nghiệp Việt Nam (TCVN).</li><li>Độ lệch màu giữa các lô nhuộm vải: Trong phạm vi cho phép 5% theo bảng màu chuẩn Pantone TPX/TCX.</li></ul></div></div></div></article></div></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-14 sm:py-18 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-800 \"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--3\"]\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none bg-&#91;radial-gradient(#38bdf8_1px,transparent_1px)&#93; &#91;background-size:24px_24px&#93;\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-&#91;11px&#93; font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xs bg-slate-800/90 border border-blue-500/40 text-blue-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-400 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\">